## Required next evidence

1. Recover the three official IonWave attachments and every addendum/Q&A without accepting new commercial terms or submitting anything.
2. Hash + inventory exact files and dates.
3. Build mandatory/mandatory-if-prime/scoreable RTM matrix.
4. Resolve whether corporate-experience, SOC 2, Virginia registration and insurance requirements may be satisfied by prime only, team collectively, or every subcontractor.
5. Map existing AquaTrace capabilities/evidence to the official RTM without inventing customer references, deployed utility history, certifications, insurance, registrations or integrations.
6. Decide `NO_BID`, `TEAMING_ONLY`, or `PRIME_ELIGIBLE` only from the recovered official package.

## Boundaries

No buyer contact, IonWave registration, terms acceptance, proposal upload, pricing commitment, customer-reference invention, certification claim, insurance claim, or submission by this qualification carrier. Any partner outreach needs separate custody and must preserve the teaming-only posture unless the official package changes the evidence.

